862 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Our workshop statement connected guest\054 agent and staff knowledge around the idea of \215feeling at home\216\056 The final playback sharpened this into two gaps\072 needs left unsaid online and situational observations that were difficult to share\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 863 0 R
     /Pg 850 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
