878 0 obj
  << /ActualText (So we now believe that helping these guests feel recognised depends on connecting the needs they choose to share with trusted human judgement and a feasible service response\056 Optional visual prompts may help assistants express unfamiliar possibilities\073 Dream Makers may add contextual understanding\054 provided each action has consent\054 ownership and delivery limits\056)
     /K [ 14 ]
     /P 879 0 R
     /Pg 850 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
